WEBVTT

00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:05.580
<i>Do you remember that summer day?</i>

00:00:06.570 --> 00:00:09.430
<i>I was pushed to the brink by the phantoms 
of Hanadori-kun and Tsukimiya-kun,</i>

00:00:09.430 --> 00:00:14.680
<i>and suddenly a girl from school showed up
in a yukata to invite me to go see fireworks.</i>

00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:18.780
<i>The day I ruined the best thing
that's ever happened to me.</i>

00:00:18.780 --> 00:00:27.000
<b>Class Trip Outline</b>

00:00:18.780 --> 00:00:27.000
Let's have fun!

00:00:19.180 --> 00:00:22.380
<i>I still haven't had the chance
 or the courage to apologize...</i>

00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:24.440
<i>But now, during the biggest
event of the school year,</i>

00:00:24.440 --> 00:00:26.160
<i>I'm ready to go for it!</i>

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:28.540
Hey, Hanadori!

00:00:28.540 --> 00:00:32.720
They say nobody really knows
exactly how it is that planes can fly.

00:00:33.350 --> 00:00:34.880
What...?

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:38.100
An evil power approaches!

00:00:38.660 --> 00:00:39.680
Let me go!

00:00:39.680 --> 00:00:41.140
Let me go right now!

00:00:40.380 --> 00:00:42.610
<i>Battle your own sense of self-control, Miguel.</i>

00:00:44.620 --> 00:00:46.940
We haven't even taken off yet!

00:00:46.940 --> 00:00:48.800
G-Gestöber!

00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:51.750
Can I hold your hand? 
The darkness is going to devour me!

00:00:51.750 --> 00:00:53.430
<i>Hell no, you creepy weirdo!</i>

00:00:58.230 --> 00:00:59.330
It's so fast!

00:01:00.090 --> 00:01:00.980
No!

00:01:02.320 --> 00:01:03.830
<i>Shut up already!</i>

00:01:03.830 --> 00:01:05.620
Are you okay, young man?

00:01:05.920 --> 00:01:07.560
He's fine.

00:01:07.560 --> 00:01:10.050
He's just got dark god of destruction sickness.

00:01:10.050 --> 00:01:11.710
Also, here's my phone number.

00:01:12.340 --> 00:01:15.110
<i>Our three-day, two-night class trip...</i>

00:01:15.920 --> 00:01:17.660
Gestöber, look!

00:01:17.660 --> 00:01:19.010
An amusement park!

00:01:19.010 --> 00:01:21.050
The masses are so easily amused, aren't they?

00:01:22.130 --> 00:01:24.980
<i>What are you so excited about?</i>

00:01:25.580 --> 00:01:27.460
<i>First, I need to lose these two.</i>

00:01:27.800 --> 00:01:29.320
<i>I don't want to be interrupted.</i>

00:01:29.930 --> 00:01:32.340
<i>I'm putting my plan into action today!</i>

00:01:44.450 --> 00:01:52.340
<b>A Destructive God Sits Next to Me</b>

00:03:03.740 --> 00:03:06.990
<b><i>Delusion 4</i></b>

00:03:04.830 --> 00:03:07.160
<i>I'll go over the plan one more time.</i>

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:08.450
<i>First:</i>

00:03:07.760 --> 00:03:09.790
Where should we start?

00:03:08.450 --> 00:03:11.390
<i>My target is Sumiso Kotoko-san from Class 4.</i>

00:03:09.790 --> 00:03:11.680
Wherever you want.

00:03:11.390 --> 00:03:13.390
<i>She's always hanging out 
with her friend Yae-san.</i>

00:03:12.550 --> 00:03:13.390
Any ideas?

00:03:14.160 --> 00:03:17.500
<i>I have to keep her in my sights to make 
sure I get a chance to talk to her.</i>

00:03:18.570 --> 00:03:20.320
What are you staring at?

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:22.680
I-I'm sorry.

00:03:22.900 --> 00:03:24.230
Let's go, Kotoko.

00:03:24.230 --> 00:03:25.390
O-Okay...

00:03:25.390 --> 00:03:26.680
<i>Second...</i>

00:03:26.680 --> 00:03:28.570
<i>They're avoiding me.</i>

00:03:28.570 --> 00:03:29.980
<i>Especially Yae-san.</i>

00:03:30.410 --> 00:03:31.460
<i>Third:</i>

00:03:31.460 --> 00:03:34.680
<i>Everyone's on cloud nine because
 we're at the amusement park.</i>

00:03:35.550 --> 00:03:38.630
<i>It's the perfect opportunity for me
to explain myself and apologize.</i>

00:03:38.630 --> 00:03:41.550
<i>And if it works out, 
we can eat churros together!</i>

00:03:42.530 --> 00:03:47.030
I was just thinking I should talk to you today.

00:03:47.580 --> 00:03:50.820
That's simultaneously optimistic,
shallow, and calculating, Seri-kun!

00:03:50.820 --> 00:03:52.850
<i>Dreams belong to those who dream them.</i>

00:03:52.850 --> 00:03:53.510
Smooth.

00:03:53.510 --> 00:03:54.880
<i>Leave me alone.</i>

00:03:54.880 --> 00:03:55.820
<i>Fourth:</i>

00:03:55.820 --> 00:03:58.920
<i>I need to ditch Hanadori and Tsukimiya,</i>

00:03:58.920 --> 00:04:02.200
<i>and catch Sumiso-san without
 Yae-san so I can talk to her.</i>

00:03:59.720 --> 00:04:01.000
I'm gonna hit up the restroom.

00:04:01.000 --> 00:04:02.480
Okay, I'll be waiting.

00:04:02.720 --> 00:04:04.500
So you're going to stalk her.

00:04:04.500 --> 00:04:05.840
<i>No, not stalk.</i>

00:04:06.050 --> 00:04:09.160
But why are you in such a hurry all of a sudden?

00:04:09.160 --> 00:04:10.440
<i>Well...</i>

00:04:10.440 --> 00:04:15.640
I bet you heard someone saying
she was cute before the class trip

00:04:10.610 --> 00:04:12.590
Sumiso-san's so cute.

00:04:12.590 --> 00:04:14.430
Maybe I'll ask her out.

00:04:15.640 --> 00:04:17.000
and panicked, didn't you?

00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:18.940
<i>If you know the answer, then don't ask!</i>

00:04:21.210 --> 00:04:24.400
<i>How were you able to hear my entire plan?!</i>

00:04:24.400 --> 00:04:27.190
What? You're so slow, Seri-kun.

00:04:27.320 --> 00:04:29.940
Turns out you're a little dense, too, huh?

00:04:29.940 --> 00:04:34.400
<i>I'm just so used to you 
being able to read my mind.</i>

00:04:34.400 --> 00:04:36.290
Besides, Seri-kun...

00:04:36.290 --> 00:04:40.120
After everything you've seen,
 if you really think you could get rid of me,

00:04:40.120 --> 00:04:42.800
you really are dense.

00:04:42.800 --> 00:04:44.920
<i>Please don't call me dense.</i>

00:04:45.070 --> 00:04:48.260
What happened that day
 was partially our fault,

00:04:48.260 --> 00:04:50.260
and I do feel bad.

00:04:50.260 --> 00:04:53.970
So don't take this all on yourself.

00:04:54.080 --> 00:04:56.940
You can count on me!

00:04:57.100 --> 00:04:59.110
Their schedules,

00:04:58.420 --> 00:04:59.860
I'm gonna spin it hard!

00:04:59.110 --> 00:05:01.030
when they're getting on rides,

00:04:59.860 --> 00:05:01.030
This is fun!

00:05:01.030 --> 00:05:03.420
Wow, this looks yummy!

00:05:01.030 --> 00:05:03.420
when they'll hit the restroom,
when they'll get hungry...

00:05:03.860 --> 00:05:07.990
Even memories from their past lives! 
I'll tell you anything you want to know.

00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:09.530
<i>Are you God?!</i>

00:05:10.660 --> 00:05:12.460
<i>No, I don't believe him for a minute.</i>

00:05:12.460 --> 00:05:14.350
<i>He's definitely planning something!</i>

00:05:14.350 --> 00:05:16.930
<i>I bet he'll start charging me halfway through!</i>

00:05:16.930 --> 00:05:19.240
Don't worry, Gestöber.

00:05:20.080 --> 00:05:22.620
No matter who it is you're fighting...

00:05:22.620 --> 00:05:25.630
With me by your side, there's nothing to fear.

00:05:25.790 --> 00:05:29.170
Because I hold the world in my very hand!

00:05:30.420 --> 00:05:31.160
Huh?

00:05:31.160 --> 00:05:32.120
Am I doing this right?

00:05:32.120 --> 00:05:34.350
<i>You're getting too excited,
dark god of destruction.</i>

00:05:32.370 --> 00:05:33.080
Look!

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:37.440
Okay, let's head this way first.

00:05:35.410 --> 00:05:36.210
Wait...

00:05:37.440 --> 00:05:38.580
Hey, wait a—

00:05:41.720 --> 00:05:43.610
What are you guys doing here?

00:05:43.980 --> 00:05:46.690
Enjoy the ride!

00:05:46.690 --> 00:05:47.940
<i>Listen, Seri-kun.</i>

00:05:48.310 --> 00:05:52.920
<i>If you try to talk to her straight-up,
 she's not going to listen,</i>

00:05:53.160 --> 00:05:57.460
<i>since you're the kind of asshole who 
hurts girls because you don't have a clue.</i>

00:05:57.780 --> 00:05:59.880
<i>So just let her have it.</i>

00:05:59.880 --> 00:06:04.070
<i>Wait for the moment you 
hit the top and start to fall.</i>

00:06:04.070 --> 00:06:07.220
<i>Let her hear your cry of love!</i>

00:06:07.540 --> 00:06:08.180
Sumi—

00:06:08.180 --> 00:06:11.480
Gestöber, never let me go!

00:06:10.610 --> 00:06:12.280
Hanadori!

00:06:12.280 --> 00:06:14.180
Welcome back!

00:06:17.660 --> 00:06:20.600
I think that took a century off my life.

00:06:21.630 --> 00:06:23.280
<i>That just freaked her out!</i>

00:06:23.280 --> 00:06:26.060
Don't worry, Seri-kun.
You'll get another chance.

00:06:26.060 --> 00:06:27.720
<i>No, I won't!</i>

00:06:27.720 --> 00:06:30.900
<i>What even </i>was<i> that plan? 
I couldn't yell in the middle of that!</i>

00:06:31.460 --> 00:06:35.180
You should've just yelled over Hanadori, 
"You've got it all wrong! I'm sorry! I love you!"

00:06:35.180 --> 00:06:36.370
<i>I couldn't yell that!</i>

00:06:36.370 --> 00:06:38.840
Okay, on to our next plan!

00:06:38.840 --> 00:06:39.500
<i>I'm worried.</i>

00:06:39.900 --> 00:06:42.640
Memories are rushing back... 
I used to ride this horse all the time!

00:06:42.640 --> 00:06:43.920
Get down!

00:06:44.130 --> 00:06:45.050
<b>Failure</b>

00:06:44.130 --> 00:06:45.050
<i>Failure.</i>

00:06:46.420 --> 00:06:49.770
I stood in line forever to 
get that for Sumiso-san!

00:06:49.770 --> 00:06:51.460
Thank you, Gestöber!

00:06:51.460 --> 00:06:52.640
<b>Failure</b>

00:06:51.460 --> 00:06:52.640
<i>Failure.</i>

00:06:53.180 --> 00:06:55.640
Hanadori-kun fell in!

00:06:55.640 --> 00:06:56.600
<b>Failure</b>

00:06:55.640 --> 00:06:56.810
<i>Failure.</i>

00:06:57.310 --> 00:06:58.670
<i>It's over.</i>

00:06:58.670 --> 00:07:01.400
<i>I never stood a chance against him.</i>

00:07:01.400 --> 00:07:04.080
That was fast!
You gave up so fast, Seri-kun!

00:07:04.080 --> 00:07:06.820
What happened to all your grand fantasies?

00:07:07.140 --> 00:07:08.780
I'm sure it'll work out next time!

00:07:08.780 --> 00:07:10.610
<i>You're only doing this for your own amusement!</i>

00:07:12.200 --> 00:07:15.370
<b>Haunted House</b>

00:07:13.010 --> 00:07:17.150
Find my wishing stone...

00:07:17.620 --> 00:07:20.000
<b>Horror Maze Forest 
of the Wishing Stone</b>

00:07:17.620 --> 00:07:20.000
<b>Find
 my
 stone...</b>

00:07:17.800 --> 00:07:20.000
The target went inside.

00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:21.880
Let's go after her, Seri-kun!

00:07:21.880 --> 00:07:23.200
Come on!

00:07:23.540 --> 00:07:26.120
My wishing stone...

00:07:23.810 --> 00:07:24.640
Please, no!

00:07:24.640 --> 00:07:26.120
Come on, inside.

00:07:26.120 --> 00:07:27.740
Stop being a wimp.

00:07:27.740 --> 00:07:29.140
You want to make up, right?

00:07:29.140 --> 00:07:31.330
Not in a haunted house!

00:07:31.330 --> 00:07:34.070
What am I supposed to say 
to her in a place like this?

00:07:34.600 --> 00:07:37.090
"Man, I just love haunted houses.

00:07:37.090 --> 00:07:40.320
You know, some folks say ghosts
are just figments of your imagination.

00:07:40.320 --> 00:07:42.890
Oh, and when I told you 
to get lost that one time,

00:07:42.890 --> 00:07:45.220
that was just a figment
of your imagination, too!"

00:07:45.220 --> 00:07:46.730
Just say that.

00:07:46.730 --> 00:07:47.700
<i>Too long!</i>

00:07:47.920 --> 00:07:49.440
<i>Not to mention terrible.</i>

00:07:49.440 --> 00:07:51.520
<i>Why would you even
think that would work?</i>

00:07:51.520 --> 00:07:53.540
<i>And you were the one calling </i>me<i> dense?</i>

00:07:53.540 --> 00:07:56.420
But, you know, we left Hanadori behind.

00:07:56.420 --> 00:07:57.880
We should hurry.

00:07:57.880 --> 00:07:59.900
He always manages to get into trouble.

00:07:59.900 --> 00:08:01.540
Sit. Stay.

00:08:01.920 --> 00:08:05.190
<i>But Hanadori-kun ruins everything.</i>

00:08:05.190 --> 00:08:07.500
<i>Tsukimiya-kun's plans are terrible, but...</i>

00:08:07.500 --> 00:08:09.000
Hey, look, Seri-kun.

00:08:09.500 --> 00:08:12.530
It says there's a stone that grants wishes.

00:08:09.510 --> 00:08:12.220
<b>Find it and win a prize</b>

00:08:09.720 --> 00:08:13.430
Find my wishing stone...

00:08:13.430 --> 00:08:15.080
<i>No way! I'm scared!</i>

00:08:16.600 --> 00:08:17.880
<i>That was the girls!</i>

00:08:21.130 --> 00:08:21.930
<i>They saw me!</i>

00:08:21.930 --> 00:08:23.490
Seri-kun, behind you.

00:08:30.220 --> 00:08:31.120
<i>Something's coming!</i>

00:08:34.420 --> 00:08:35.530
Hanadori-kun?!

00:08:37.840 --> 00:08:40.700
What happened, Hanadori? 
I thought you were waiting outside.

00:08:44.460 --> 00:08:45.320
Huh?

00:08:45.320 --> 00:08:48.500
Is that the ghost's wishing stone?

00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:49.420
<i>What ghost?</i>

00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:50.880
<b>Horror Maze Forest of the Wishing Stone</b>

00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:50.880
<b>Find
 my
 stone...</b>

00:08:51.390 --> 00:08:55.080
<i>He looks kinda like No-F*ce right now.</i>

00:08:55.730 --> 00:08:57.790
G-Gestöber...

00:08:57.790 --> 00:09:00.410
seemed like he was battling something.

00:09:01.460 --> 00:09:04.260
So I wanted him to have
the courage to face it.

00:09:05.640 --> 00:09:07.260
<i>For me?</i>

00:09:09.110 --> 00:09:10.190
<i>What gives?</i>

00:09:10.720 --> 00:09:12.520
<i>You're such a scaredy-cat.</i>

00:09:13.230 --> 00:09:15.420
<i>I left you behind, and you did this for me?</i>

00:09:15.990 --> 00:09:18.680
You can do it, Gestöber.

00:09:18.680 --> 00:09:20.330
<i>Quit acting like No-F*ce!</i>

00:09:20.800 --> 00:09:21.800
<i>Damn it...</i>

00:09:23.540 --> 00:09:25.000
Thanks.

00:09:26.560 --> 00:09:28.460
Ugh, you again?

00:09:28.690 --> 00:09:30.400
What is with you guys?

00:09:30.400 --> 00:09:32.280
You keep showing up wherever we go.

00:09:32.920 --> 00:09:34.290
Knock it off—

00:09:34.290 --> 00:09:35.140
Sumiso-san,

00:09:36.040 --> 00:09:38.370
I'd like to talk to you.

00:09:39.930 --> 00:09:43.060
Could I have a moment of your time?

00:09:48.080 --> 00:09:49.000
Okay.

00:09:53.400 --> 00:09:55.800
Hey! Why is she running off
 with a guy like him?

00:09:55.800 --> 00:09:57.460
Come on, Yae-san.

00:09:57.460 --> 00:10:00.910
I didn't think you were that nosy.

00:10:00.910 --> 00:10:03.180
What do you know about me?!

00:10:03.180 --> 00:10:05.710
What do <i>you</i> know about Seri-kun?

00:10:06.820 --> 00:10:08.790
He's a coward.

00:10:08.790 --> 00:10:13.260
He's shy, he acts on his emotions, 
and he can be dense...

00:10:13.820 --> 00:10:15.740
But he's not so bad.

00:10:16.410 --> 00:10:17.810
You thought I was someone else?

00:10:17.810 --> 00:10:21.270
Hanadori-kun and Tsukimiya-kun
had asked to hang out that day,

00:10:21.270 --> 00:10:22.940
but I turned them down...

00:10:23.390 --> 00:10:29.650
Because I thought that... y-you might
contact me over summer break.

00:10:31.100 --> 00:10:34.560
And I didn't want to miss hearing from you.

00:10:34.560 --> 00:10:37.080
Hanadori-kun's not all bad,

00:10:37.080 --> 00:10:40.040
but he's caused me a lot of grief...

00:10:40.040 --> 00:10:42.710
I thought you were him! That's why I yelled!

00:10:42.920 --> 00:10:45.220
I'm sorry for upsetting you!

00:10:45.220 --> 00:10:48.240
Then it wasn't because
you didn't want to see me?

00:10:48.240 --> 00:10:50.840
Absolutely not! I was looking 
forward to seeing you.

00:10:50.840 --> 00:10:53.540
I thought I was telling 
Hanadori-kun to get lost.

00:10:53.730 --> 00:10:55.600
I... I see...

00:10:55.600 --> 00:10:58.260
But is it okay to say that...

00:10:58.760 --> 00:10:59.960
right in front of him?

00:11:00.370 --> 00:11:02.180
Wh-Wh-What are you doing here?!

00:11:02.410 --> 00:11:06.080
Gestöber, I didn't know you felt that way...

00:11:06.640 --> 00:11:09.620
You asked why I didn't come over that day,

00:11:09.620 --> 00:11:12.200
so I thought it was okay to show up.

00:11:12.600 --> 00:11:17.040
The mango lassi at Maruyama Café was 
delicious, and I wanted you to try it,

00:11:17.040 --> 00:11:20.080
b-but I didn't w-want to bother you...

00:11:17.850 --> 00:11:20.080
Wait... U-Um...

00:11:20.090 --> 00:11:23.340
You said that no matter what
happened in our last life,

00:11:23.340 --> 00:11:25.130
Gestöber and Sturmhut
would always be together...

00:11:25.130 --> 00:11:26.030
<i>No, I didn't.</i>

00:11:26.030 --> 00:11:31.830
We spent so many nights together
sharing our deepest secrets...

00:11:31.830 --> 00:11:36.040
Whoa, whoa, whoa...

00:11:32.820 --> 00:11:34.430
<i>What song is that?</i>

00:11:34.430 --> 00:11:36.500
<i>She's freaked out! 
You freaked Sumiso-san out!</i>

00:11:36.500 --> 00:11:40.100
I knew you were going to 
fight a great battle today,

00:11:38.650 --> 00:11:40.960
<i>No, stop! Where's this coming from?!</i>

00:11:40.100 --> 00:11:41.960
and I wanted to cheer you on...

00:11:42.120 --> 00:11:44.300
Hey, uh, Hanadori-ku—

00:11:45.400 --> 00:11:49.090
This stupid thing! This stupid thing...

00:11:51.650 --> 00:11:53.760
Stupid... thing...

00:11:54.350 --> 00:11:55.020
I...

00:11:55.370 --> 00:11:57.570
I'm sorry, Hanadori-kun!

00:11:57.570 --> 00:12:01.760
<i>I, Koyuki Seri, being too skilled at 
making Hanadori-kun feel guilty,</i>

00:12:01.760 --> 00:12:02.820
<i>was thusly defeated.</i>

00:12:02.820 --> 00:12:05.950
Well, I'll be cheering both of you on.

00:12:05.950 --> 00:12:06.790
Let's go, Kotoko.

00:12:06.790 --> 00:12:11.000
<i>Day one ended with Sumiso-san
getting some weird idea...</i>

00:12:09.240 --> 00:12:11.000
<b>Haha</b>

00:12:10.060 --> 00:12:11.000
<b>Haha</b>

00:12:11.120 --> 00:12:16.210
<b>Haha</b>

00:12:11.120 --> 00:12:16.210
<b>Haha</b>

00:12:12.480 --> 00:12:14.900
<b>Gloom</b>

00:12:12.720 --> 00:12:16.220
<i>and another misunderstanding.</i>

00:12:16.500 --> 00:12:17.600
Yae-chan,

00:12:17.600 --> 00:12:21.760
the two of them might be 
fighting something in secret.

00:12:21.760 --> 00:12:22.600
Huh?

00:12:23.260 --> 00:12:26.060
Wakiarai Temple,
 the place we're visiting today,

00:12:26.060 --> 00:12:30.340
is a famous historical... power spot.

00:12:30.340 --> 00:12:34.110
And, uh... it grants wishes.

00:12:32.620 --> 00:12:34.980
Sensei, stop reading from the book!

00:12:35.850 --> 00:12:38.040
<i>Wishes, huh?</i>

00:12:39.110 --> 00:12:39.610
<b>H\hM\hP\hH\h!</b>

00:12:40.580 --> 00:12:42.860
<i>H-He's infuriating...</i>

00:12:44.090 --> 00:12:46.040
<i>Day two of the class trip...</i>

00:12:46.040 --> 00:12:48.800
<i>Hanadori-kun's as pissed as ever.</i>

00:12:48.800 --> 00:12:50.910
That's bad manners, Hanadori.

00:12:50.910 --> 00:12:52.910
<i>He's making it so obvious that he's angry.</i>

00:12:52.910 --> 00:12:54.160
<i>I don't even care.</i>

00:12:56.650 --> 00:12:59.200
<i>Huh? It's more bubbly than usual...</i>

00:12:59.290 --> 00:13:02.130
<b>Haha</b>

00:12:59.290 --> 00:13:02.130
<b>Haha</b>

00:12:59.540 --> 00:13:02.910
<i>He pulled childish pranks like that,</i>

00:13:02.910 --> 00:13:04.720
<i>and I woke up in the middle of the night...</i>

00:13:06.920 --> 00:13:09.150
<i>to find I was part of some weird ritual.</i>

00:13:11.280 --> 00:13:14.420
Hey, watch where you're goin'!
You slammed into me!

00:13:14.420 --> 00:13:16.300
What school are you from, punk?

00:13:16.740 --> 00:13:18.650
Get 'em, boss!

00:13:17.660 --> 00:13:20.440
<i>Then he shoved me in front of some 
scary guy from another school...</i>

00:13:18.660 --> 00:13:20.440
Wh-Who are you calling "boss"?!

00:13:20.610 --> 00:13:21.440
<b>Hmph!</b>

00:13:21.440 --> 00:13:22.560
<i>And...</i>

00:13:23.820 --> 00:13:25.240
<i>You can do it!</i>

00:13:25.240 --> 00:13:28.860
<i>Sumiso-san still seems to have the wrong idea.</i>

00:13:29.810 --> 00:13:32.210
<i>Dear God, I'm so tired.</i>

00:13:32.660 --> 00:13:35.930
<i>Why did Hanadori-kun and 
Tsukimiya-kun choose me?</i>

00:13:36.800 --> 00:13:39.640
<i>Please send them somewhere far away</i>

00:13:39.640 --> 00:13:42.640
<i>where I'll never have to deal with them again.</i>

00:13:42.640 --> 00:13:44.300
<i>Please, God.</i>

00:13:46.760 --> 00:13:47.720
<i>Just kidding.</i>

00:13:48.250 --> 00:13:49.480
Okay, people!

00:13:49.480 --> 00:13:52.640
Split up into groups and enjoy the sights.

00:13:52.640 --> 00:13:54.280
Make sure you all get along.

00:13:53.680 --> 00:13:55.350
<b>Hmph!</b>

00:13:55.350 --> 00:13:57.560
<i>Hey, he left me!</i>

00:14:00.190 --> 00:14:03.440
<b>Rrgh</b>

00:14:01.520 --> 00:14:02.370
<i>Fine.</i>

00:14:02.370 --> 00:14:05.530
<i>If that's what you want,
it works out great for me.</i>

00:14:05.530 --> 00:14:06.660
Huh?

00:14:06.660 --> 00:14:08.050
Looks like I got separated!

00:14:16.150 --> 00:14:19.080
Tuna-flavored ice cream! Yum!

00:14:19.730 --> 00:14:21.520
Hey! Where are we going next?

00:14:21.520 --> 00:14:23.790
I want to take some photos
at the tuna museum.

00:14:23.790 --> 00:14:26.930
Koyuki, are you sure you 
should be with our group?

00:14:26.930 --> 00:14:28.140
You'll get in trouble.

00:14:28.140 --> 00:14:29.360
It's fine.

00:14:29.360 --> 00:14:31.240
They're the ones who ran off on me.

00:14:31.240 --> 00:14:34.640
And here I thought you'd finally
made some friends besides me.

00:14:34.640 --> 00:14:35.970
Don't be rude!

00:14:37.640 --> 00:14:40.080
<i>Are they worried about me?</i>

00:14:40.500 --> 00:14:41.910
<i>Yeah, right.</i>

00:14:41.910 --> 00:14:44.000
<i>They're probably secretly
 watching me from afar,</i>

00:14:44.000 --> 00:14:46.070
<i>hoping I'll be looking for them.</i>

00:14:46.070 --> 00:14:47.350
Forget 'em.

00:14:49.280 --> 00:14:50.370
Seriously?

00:14:50.370 --> 00:14:51.720
That's so dumb!

00:14:51.410 --> 00:14:53.370
<b>Grilled Salmon</b>

00:14:51.720 --> 00:14:53.370
What a total waste of time.

00:14:53.370 --> 00:14:55.660
Well, you know...

00:14:53.700 --> 00:14:55.660
They're from Numa High.

00:14:55.660 --> 00:14:57.080
Those guys are bad news.

00:14:57.080 --> 00:14:58.560
Stay away from them, Koyuki.

00:14:58.560 --> 00:14:59.930
S-Sure...

00:15:00.920 --> 00:15:02.660
<i>Wait, aren't they the ones that...</i>

00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:05.060
Koyuki?

00:15:05.060 --> 00:15:05.970
<i>Don't tell me...</i>

00:15:07.520 --> 00:15:12.050
Thanks for splashing dressing
all over me back there.

00:15:12.050 --> 00:15:14.560
I need to thank you for that.

00:15:16.440 --> 00:15:17.730
<i>No way!</i>

00:15:17.730 --> 00:15:19.060
<i>If that happened,</i>

00:15:19.060 --> 00:15:22.400
<i>Hanadori-kun would shake like a cell phone
 on vibrate and just hand over his money...</i>

00:15:22.710 --> 00:15:25.240
<i>even though he was looking forward
to buying souvenirs for everyone.</i>

00:15:29.240 --> 00:15:31.070
Memories From My Class Trip

00:15:32.550 --> 00:15:34.460
<i>I just made myself feel bad.</i>

00:15:34.940 --> 00:15:36.600
<i>I'm so dumb.</i>

00:15:36.600 --> 00:15:39.950
<i>Worrying about him is just
giving him what he wants.</i>

00:15:40.410 --> 00:15:41.740
Koyuki,

00:15:41.740 --> 00:15:45.880
someone says they saw Hanadori get 
dragged off by guys from another school.

00:15:45.880 --> 00:15:46.840
Is he okay?

00:15:48.940 --> 00:15:49.760
Koyuki?

00:15:51.600 --> 00:15:54.920
<i>God, this isn't what I wanted!</i>

00:15:57.430 --> 00:15:58.350
<b>Him</b>

00:15:57.430 --> 00:15:58.350
<b>Here</b>

00:16:01.680 --> 00:16:03.500
<i>I-I came unarmed...</i>

00:16:03.500 --> 00:16:04.390
<i>What do I do?</i>

00:16:04.390 --> 00:16:06.490
<i>I wonder if Tsukimiya-kun is with him.</i>

00:16:06.760 --> 00:16:09.020
<i>Is this really the one time he isn't around?</i>

00:16:09.020 --> 00:16:10.440
<i>Why me?</i>

00:16:10.980 --> 00:16:12.150
<i>But...</i>

00:16:16.860 --> 00:16:19.780
<i>So I wanted him to have
the courage to face it.</i>

00:16:20.300 --> 00:16:21.520
<i>All right...</i>

00:16:21.520 --> 00:16:24.080
<i>I'll start by getting a look inside.</i>

00:16:25.300 --> 00:16:26.750
<i>Hanadori-kun!</i>

00:16:26.750 --> 00:16:28.460
You like it, right?

00:16:28.460 --> 00:16:30.710
Don't hold back. Sing for me.

00:16:30.710 --> 00:16:31.900
No...

00:16:31.900 --> 00:16:33.800
I left that life behind!

00:16:33.980 --> 00:16:37.440
Do you think that I... no, the world...

00:16:37.440 --> 00:16:40.260
would let someone with your abilities go?

00:16:40.470 --> 00:16:42.560
You remember, don't you?

00:16:42.560 --> 00:16:44.980
When you bathed in dark power...

00:16:46.230 --> 00:16:49.480
In the lunar labyrinth,
in the land of darkness...

00:16:49.480 --> 00:16:50.440
Stop!

00:16:50.620 --> 00:16:53.410
Scream and cry in the void
between life and death...

00:16:53.880 --> 00:16:56.320
The despair of destruction.

00:16:57.070 --> 00:16:59.580
<b>BAAAM</b>

00:16:57.240 --> 00:16:59.570
Sing, Dead Bull!

00:17:00.220 --> 00:17:01.930
<i>What? What are they doing?</i>

00:17:01.930 --> 00:17:03.060
<i>Do they know him?</i>

00:17:03.060 --> 00:17:05.200
<i>"Dead Bull"? They're dead?</i>

00:17:06.810 --> 00:17:09.170
Your body is honest, even if you aren't.

00:17:09.170 --> 00:17:12.140
You really never change, huh?

00:17:12.300 --> 00:17:13.900
In middle school,

00:17:13.900 --> 00:17:16.510
I fell in love with your soul and your singing.

00:17:16.510 --> 00:17:17.120
<i>His singing?!</i>

00:17:17.120 --> 00:17:18.360
I told you that together,

00:17:18.360 --> 00:17:21.100
we could take over the world. Remember?

00:17:21.230 --> 00:17:23.810
Sturmhut doesn't want that.

00:17:24.830 --> 00:17:25.980
Silence.

00:17:25.980 --> 00:17:29.530
Your body doesn't belong to you alone.

00:17:30.470 --> 00:17:33.060
The cheers at the festival...

00:17:33.060 --> 00:17:35.760
That felt so great, didn't it?

00:17:35.760 --> 00:17:37.120
<i>You sang at festivals?!</i>

00:17:37.340 --> 00:17:38.250
It did,

00:17:38.250 --> 00:17:40.120
and I'm grateful to you.

00:17:40.120 --> 00:17:42.950
You slaked both my thirst and Miguel's.

00:17:43.380 --> 00:17:46.300
<i>I had no idea about this dark
history of Hanadori-kun's...</i>

00:17:46.300 --> 00:17:47.790
<i>And I wish I still didn't.</i>

00:17:47.790 --> 00:17:51.840
But I've recalled my destiny as Sturmhut.

00:17:51.840 --> 00:17:54.550
Gestöber showed me the light.

00:17:54.550 --> 00:17:56.500
<i>Please, no. Don't mention me.</i>

00:17:56.680 --> 00:17:57.760
<i>What's wrong with you?</i>

00:17:57.760 --> 00:18:00.300
<i>If you know people like you,
be friends with them.</i>

00:18:00.300 --> 00:18:01.760
<i>I was stupid to worry.</i>

00:18:01.760 --> 00:18:07.950
And it was a man named Tsukimiya Utsugi
 who guided me to Gestöber.

00:18:08.510 --> 00:18:12.460
He told me he was my partner in my last life.

00:18:08.870 --> 00:18:10.790
<i>H-Huh?</i>

00:18:11.120 --> 00:18:16.160
<i>So the reason Hanadori-kun
won't leave me alone is...</i>

00:18:16.900 --> 00:18:19.020
Because of Tsukimiya-kun?!

00:18:19.020 --> 00:18:20.040
That's right.

00:18:21.150 --> 00:18:22.640
What the hell did you do?!

00:18:22.640 --> 00:18:25.560
And when did you get here?!
Where the hell have you been?!

00:18:25.560 --> 00:18:27.810
Seri-kun, you're so happy that you're crying!

00:18:27.810 --> 00:18:29.580
Like hell I am!

00:18:29.840 --> 00:18:33.420
I've seen this "Gestöber."

00:18:33.780 --> 00:18:36.510
But he's not worthy of you.

00:18:37.380 --> 00:18:43.760
With the way he treats you, 
he can't have the soul of a hero.

00:18:43.760 --> 00:18:44.840
<i>Yeah, that's right!</i>

00:18:45.120 --> 00:18:48.360
And you looked unhappy 
the whole time yourself.

00:18:49.150 --> 00:18:51.190
Come back to me, Miguel.

00:18:51.680 --> 00:18:56.040
You belong at Tokimune Shikimi's side.

00:18:56.040 --> 00:18:58.000
<i>Yeah! Do it, Hanadori-kun!</i>

00:18:58.000 --> 00:18:59.900
<i>I'll tell the teacher what's up.</i>

00:18:59.120 --> 00:19:03.200
He doesn't think about you at all.

00:18:59.900 --> 00:19:01.500
<i>Bye! Have a nice life!</i>

00:19:03.200 --> 00:19:03.910
<i>What?</i>

00:19:03.910 --> 00:19:07.380
I can't allow a man like that to stand by you.

00:19:07.380 --> 00:19:10.270
<i>Who doesn't think about Hanadori-kun at all?</i>

00:19:10.270 --> 00:19:14.340
<i>Do you know how much of my
life I've wasted on him?</i>

00:19:14.340 --> 00:19:15.880
<i>You don't know a damn thing!</i>

00:19:15.880 --> 00:19:18.940
Are you that much of a fool?

00:19:19.560 --> 00:19:21.880
Surely you understand, Miguel.

00:19:21.880 --> 00:19:23.020
It's true...

00:19:23.020 --> 00:19:24.910
I may be a fool.

00:19:24.910 --> 00:19:29.340
But if letting logic decide your partner
 is the smart thing to do...

00:19:31.070 --> 00:19:33.940
I don't need to be smart.

00:19:37.360 --> 00:19:39.700
You always did know
how to make me shiver.

00:19:39.700 --> 00:19:41.490
<i>I've got the shivers, too.</i>

00:19:41.860 --> 00:19:43.170
<i>What's with these two?</i>

00:19:43.170 --> 00:19:44.780
<i>It's like they're drunk on youth!</i>

00:19:44.780 --> 00:19:46.200
<i>I can't take this!</i>

00:19:46.200 --> 00:19:48.890
Tell me one last thing before you go.

00:19:48.890 --> 00:19:50.680
Why him?

00:19:50.680 --> 00:19:53.420
Is it really just a connection
from a past life?

00:19:53.740 --> 00:19:56.120
<i>Why me?</i>

00:19:56.620 --> 00:19:59.340
It was our first year of high school...

00:20:03.920 --> 00:20:06.750
I saw Gestöber crying behind the school.

00:20:07.450 --> 00:20:11.100
I don't know why, but he was whispering...

00:20:11.570 --> 00:20:14.180
They're so stupid.

00:20:14.180 --> 00:20:16.070
They're not even that strong.

00:20:16.380 --> 00:20:20.520
If I had someone really strong for a friend,

00:20:21.040 --> 00:20:23.570
I bet they'd all run away!

00:20:23.570 --> 00:20:25.460
God's not fair!

00:20:27.130 --> 00:20:29.220
<i>Who do you think I am?</i>

00:20:29.220 --> 00:20:31.960
<i>I swear on my name that
I will grant your wish.</i>

00:20:31.960 --> 00:20:34.220
<i>I will become the friend you long for!</i>

00:20:34.710 --> 00:20:38.250
That was when a heart of light started
 beating within the dark god of destruc—

00:20:38.250 --> 00:20:40.160
Stop it!

00:20:39.560 --> 00:20:41.100
G-Gestöber!

00:20:40.530 --> 00:20:42.230
Lies! All lies!

00:20:42.230 --> 00:20:45.940
Why did you have to hear that?!

00:20:45.940 --> 00:20:48.040
So that's what you were thinking, Seri-kun?

00:20:48.580 --> 00:20:49.640
No! No!

00:20:49.900 --> 00:20:52.600
We were studying Chopin in music class,

00:20:52.600 --> 00:20:56.340
and I accidentally called him "Chopping"!
I got upset because everyone laughed at me!

00:20:56.340 --> 00:20:58.830
I was just venting!

00:20:58.830 --> 00:21:01.300
I don't really think stuff like that!

00:21:01.300 --> 00:21:04.200
Yeah, it would be pretty
embarrassing if you did!

00:21:04.200 --> 00:21:05.070
Stop it!

00:21:05.460 --> 00:21:06.580
Chopping?

00:21:06.820 --> 00:21:08.620
Don't you laugh, too!

00:21:08.620 --> 00:21:11.990
How did this end up with
 <i>you</i> taking pity on <i>me</i>?!

00:21:11.990 --> 00:21:13.440
It's not fair!

00:21:13.830 --> 00:21:16.750
This is the life you asked for, Seri-kun.

00:21:16.940 --> 00:21:20.720
God's been granting your wishes all along.

00:21:21.060 --> 00:21:22.560
Gestöber!

00:21:23.040 --> 00:21:25.240
Wake up, Gestöber!

00:21:26.330 --> 00:21:28.510
You've gotten soft, Miguel.

00:21:28.980 --> 00:21:31.050
But I won't give up.

00:21:31.050 --> 00:21:34.560
Not until I've sharpened your blade again.

00:21:34.560 --> 00:21:38.090
<i>I, however, didn't hear his ominous
 proclamation that he would return.</i>

00:21:38.090 --> 00:21:40.620
<i>I don't even know what happened after that,</i>

00:21:40.620 --> 00:21:42.440
<i>other than that our trip came to an end.</i>

00:21:42.440 --> 00:21:44.400
<b>Memories From My Class Trip</b>

00:21:44.410 --> 00:21:46.360
What's wrong with Koyuki?

00:21:46.360 --> 00:21:48.580
Culture shock, maybe?

00:21:46.360 --> 00:21:54.250
RIP
Koyuki

00:21:46.360 --> 00:21:54.250
RIP
Koyuki

00:21:46.360 --> 00:21:54.250
RIP
Koyuki

00:21:46.360 --> 00:21:54.250
RIP
Koyuki

00:21:46.360 --> 00:21:54.250
RIP
Koyuki

00:21:46.360 --> 00:21:54.250
RIP
Koyuki

00:21:46.360 --> 00:21:54.250
RIP
Koyuki

00:21:46.360 --> 00:21:54.250
RIP
Koyuki

00:21:48.580 --> 00:21:50.160
Gestöber!

00:21:50.160 --> 00:21:53.680
<i>Dear God, please make it 
so this never happened...</i>

00:23:26.270 --> 00:23:29.340
I said I'd help, but I didn't
think you'd make me do this...

00:23:29.340 --> 00:23:31.960
I've been outside the keyframe
 artist's house for three hours.

00:23:32.680 --> 00:23:35.390
Hibiki-kun, is that keyframe ready yet?

00:23:35.390 --> 00:23:36.980
Finish it up already!

00:23:37.700 --> 00:23:39.440
We won't make it in time for airing!
